<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- THE LAUNCH PICTURE (Part 12.3): iOS shows it before the app runs; it is the loading screen's first frame (our cream,
     the logo's light at its start, the logo at rest, centred), drawn by the app itself (driver "sheet launch"), so
     nothing jumps when the loading screen takes over. -->
